# ReportForge Project

## Mission

ReportForge is a reporting framework.

It is NOT a PDF library.

Developers describe reports.

The framework determines layout.

The renderer generates the output.

## Vision

Build the best open-source reporting framework for Node.js.

Developer experience is the highest priority.

## Principles

- Beautiful API
- Extensible
- Renderer independent
- Type-safe
- Production-ready
